<title>ESTONIA: TALLINNA PROFIT FORECAST UNCHANGED.</title>
<headline>TALLINNA PROFIT FORECAST UNCHANGED.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tallinna Pank's board did not make any changes to the bank's 1997 profit forecast on Monday, deputy chairman Targo Raus said.</p>
<p>Tallinna Pank earlier said the the board would discuss a revision to its 1997 profit forecast on July 14.</p>
<p>&quot;The board did not change the profit estimate,&quot; Raus told Reuters, refusing to go into more detail of what was discussed at the meeting.</p>
<p>The bank was five million kroons ahead of its planned result at the end of June. Its 1997 estimate is 71.5 million kroons.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
